@GSB_project.WebApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7161
# API_TOKEN must be supplied in the HTTP client's local environment, never committed.

### Reader, Manager or Admin
GET {{GSB_project.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv API_TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json

### Manager or Admin
GET {{GSB_project.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/participants/1
Authorization: Bearer {{$processEnv API_TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json
